__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Generated outputs. Only the current run's committed evidence stays: the
# scorecard results.json, summary.json and ~10 representative RunRecords under
# out/lechef/evidence/. Per-session records (155 files) and the derived harness
# scripts are reproducible from the corpus (to_harness.py + the Part 1 CLI).
# Stale root-level outputs from earlier suite.py invocations stay untracked.
out/*
!out/lechef/
out/lechef/records/
out/harness-scripts/
